    <h2>Are samples available?</h2>
    <p>Yes, for most products. Sample availability depends on season (for fresh produce, samples are limited to harvest windows) and product type — ask when you send your requirement and we'll confirm what's currently available.</p>

    <h2>Is there a charge?</h2>
    <p>Small samples may be provided free of charge; courier costs are typically covered by the buyer. Larger sample quantities, or samples requiring special handling (frozen seafood, for example), may carry a charge that's credited against your first bulk order. Exact terms are confirmed per request.</p>

    <h2>How long does it take?</h2>
    <p>Courier delivery time depends on your location and customs clearance at your end. For perishable samples (fresh produce, frozen seafood), we'll flag realistic delivery windows so the sample arrives usable.</p>

    <h2>What do I need to provide?</h2>
    <p>Your shipping address, any import permit or documentation your country requires for sample-quantity imports (this varies, especially for seafood and plant products), and your target specification so we send a representative sample.</p>

    <h2>Request a sample</h2>
    <p>Use the form below, or send your product and destination via WhatsApp — mention that you'd like a sample and we'll confirm availability and terms.</p>
